Package: gunyahvm-guest-kernel
Architecture: arm64
Depends: python3 (>= 3.11)
Description: GunyahVM guest kernel and boot payload
 Linux 7.2.15-gvm62, matching modules and generic Ubuntu arm64 initrd.
 This payload is delivered to guests; it never updates the host bootloader.

